      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vancouver%2C_Washington",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Since the mid‑1960s, the city has hosted a Fourth of July fireworks display on Fort Vancouver National Historic Site grounds.",
